<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>My First Web Page</title>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>My First Web Page</h1>

    <hr>

    <p>
        Hi, my name is Ayush Shakya. I am a student who is interested in
        technology and programming. I enjoy learning web development, SQL, Python,
        and exploring new concepts in computer science.
    </p>

    <h2>Google</h2>

    <hr>

    <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">Click me</a>

    <h2>My Favorite Cartoon Character</h2>

    <hr>

    <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/kgFy7KSs/goku.png" alt="Goku on Flying Nimbus" width="300">

    <h2>My Favorite Hobby</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        One of my favorite hobbies is <strong>traveling</strong>. I also
        <em>enjoy</em> gaming and spending time in the mountains whenever I get free time.
    </p>

    <h2>Two Sentences with Line Break</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        I started learning HTML and Python a few months ago.<br>
        It has become one of my favorite subjects to explore.
    </p>

    <h2>Meaningful Quote</h2>

    <hr>

    <blockquote>
        "The only way to do great work is to love what you do."
        <br>&mdash; Steve Jobs
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Heading Levels</h2>

    <hr>

    <h1>Ujjwal Pratap Singh</h1>
    <h2>Student</h2>
    <h3>Gaming, Traveling, and Mountains</h3>

    <h2>Mark and Small Tag</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        My <mark>favorite programming languages</mark> are SQL and Python,
        because they help me work with data and build useful projects.
        <small>(Updated recently)</small>
    </p>

    <h2>Strong and Em Together</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        I <strong>truly enjoy</strong> traveling to new places, and I always
        try to explore <em>mountains</em> whenever I get the chance.
    </p>

    <h2>Inline Code</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        In JavaScript, you can print "Hello World" using
        <code>console.log("Hello World");</code>
    </p>

    <h2>Span Elements</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        My favorite interests are
        <span>SQL</span>,
        <span>Python</span>, and
        <span>Gaming</span> —
        each one keeps me curious and motivated to learn more.
    </p>

    <h2>Creative Paragraph with Inline Elements</h2>

    <hr>

    <p>
        Welcome to my <strong>journey</strong> of learning! <em>Every day</em>
        I discover something new.<br>
        My current favorite topic is <mark>Python and SQL</mark>.
        <small>(Last updated: 2025)</small>
    </p>

    <h2>Website Header Section</h2>

    <hr>

    <header>
        <h1>ayush shakya </h1>
    </header>

    <h2>Navigation Section</h2>

    <hr>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a> |
        <a href="#">About</a> |
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <h2>Main Section</h2>

    <hr>

    <main>

        <p>
            Hi, I am ayush shakya  . This page is about who I am and what
            I enjoy doing, including SQL, Python, traveling, gaming, and mountains.
        </p>

        <section>
            <h2>+- Me</h2>
            <p>
                I am a student who loves working with SQL and Python. Apart from
                coding, I enjoy traveling to new places, playing games, and
                spending time in the mountains whenever possible.-
            </p>
        </section>

        <article>
            <h2>My First Blog</h2>
            <p>
                Today I wrote my very first webpage using pure HTML! It was
                exciting to see how simple tags like headings, paragraphs, and
                links come together to form a complete page. I can't wait to
                learn CSS and JavaScript next to make my pages even more interactive.
            </p>
        </article>

        <aside>
            <h2>Useful Links</h2>
            <a href="#" target="_blank">My Portfolio</a><br>
            <a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">Google</a>
        </aside>

    </main>

    <h2>Footer Section</h2>

    <hr>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Ayush Shakya . All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>